ared with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":". Its stored properties"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are its properties, so a misspelled or mistyped one is a compile error. Its type gives the name"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destinations record it under, the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory"},{"type":"text","text":" whose consent decides whether it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivered, and the version of its shape. Each has a default: the type’s name,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory\/analytics"},{"type":"text","text":" and 1."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two property types carry rules of their own. A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" value, such as an email address,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prints as ","type":"text"},{"code":"<redacted>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and has no public accessor: a destination reads it through","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/reveal(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", which gives ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" once a delivery has redacted the record. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refined","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" value satisfies every ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Constraint","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refinement","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" lists, checked once as 